### fr_germany_love is the general opinion of french people towards Germany - slightly biases french people towards voting for parties ideologically similar to Germanys gov, or the SFIO if the SPD is in government.
### aslo is specifically for the Alsace Lorraine - boosts referendum to give Germany back the Alsace
### aslo ethnicity is a spectrum between fully french and fully german - boosts referendum to give Germany back the Alsace
### relation is obvious
### France gov is left-cartel / popular front / whatever
